  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Definitional Mission - Kazakhstan Rail, through U.S. Government - Trade and Development Agency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This definitional mission identified and evaluated opportunities in Kazakhstan&apos;s rail sector for USTDA funding consideration. Kazakhstan is heavily dependent upon their rail system for both the movement of people and goods. The government has made the development and modernization of the rail sector a priority and plans to invest $40 billion through 2020.</narrative>
  </description>
